popup_text = "High Street, so named because it's the highest you can go up the mountain before entering the nobles quarter, is a sight to behold. Fifteen strides wide, and faced with facades and columns of sunset-orange sandstone, shipped at runious expense by steam funicular from the deeper delvings to the north - and this isn't even the fanciest part of the city."
button_text = "You feel slightly out of place."
